│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ identity_cz_readout                                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Collapse the ansatz to one parameter-free CZ gate. Because the same block is repeated six │
│                          │ times and CZ is self-inverse, the complete variational stack is exactly the identity:     │
│                          │ CZ^6 = I. The classifier therefore uses the dataset’s original averaged Z-Z signal        │
│                          │ without unnecessary circuit distortion. This is well motivated by the baseline’s perfect  │
│                          │ accuracy and convergence after the first epoch, which indicate that the fixed readout     │
│                          │ already exposes the target strongly. The edit reduces total trainable parameters from 146 │
│                          │ to only the two readout calibration parameters, sharply improving parameter efficiency    │
│                          │ while also reducing depth, gate count, optimization noise, and overfitting risk.          │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
