│ patch_description        │ This block reduces each repetition to only three independent circuit parameters: one      │
│                          │ shared RY angle and two parity-shared RZ angles. The alternating RZ parameters retain     │
│                          │ more flexibility than a fully global rotation while strongly reducing overfitting and     │
│                          │ optimization cost. A fixed CZ ring supplies nearest-neighbor entanglement, including the  │
│                          │ previously missing wraparound connection between qubits 7 and 0. Placing the CZ ring      │
│                          │ between noncommuting rotation layers makes all six repetitions useful while keeping the   │
│                          │ total ansatz parameter count at 18.                                                       │
